{"skill":{"slug":"cold-email","displayName":"MachFive Cold Email"},"version":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1782745516283,"changelog":"- Improved documentation for cold email campaign setup, generation, and async polling.\n- Clarified required and optional parameters for building and generating emails.\n- Added detailed chat-agent playbook with step-by-step conversational flow.\n- Provided ready-to-use bash polling loops for MachFive async operations.\n- Expanded instructions on handling CTAs, email signatures, and credit costs.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":28274,"sha256":"eaa3b37e527b06fdb9f1adbe9094ef7384ad5167ab3939f7c4368930a1d5d228","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2343,"sha256":"1c97c80b15e3783371e9748bb31a44b195fd0c192be2f336d049d0cdf6021989","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789029976199,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"69791d0279e4ab0db71def3db3e023ddb24329e5fd343f766a853836deadde55","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/69791d0279e4ab0db71def3db3e023ddb24329e5fd343f766a853836deadde55","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1782749506621},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789029976199},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a coherent MachFive API guide for building cold-email campaigns and generating email sequences, with costs and external data use disclosed.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill uses an external SaaS API and may send lead emails, names, company details, LinkedIn URLs, websites, signatures, and optional notification addresses to MachFive, which is expected for this integration and disclosed.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact is a Markdown-only skill requiring a MACHFIVE_API_KEY environment variable; no executable installer, bundled code, dependency installation, or tool replacement was present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to MachFive endpoints and include user-facing steps for selecting campaigns, gathering required configuration, confirming credit cost before paid actions, and polling async jobs.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"It can create persistent MachFive workspace objects such as campaigns, saved signatures, generated lists, and background batch jobs, but these are purpose-aligned and tied to user-directed API actions.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The API calls, lead data handling, campaign creation, signature management, previews, batch generation, enrichment, polling, and exports all directly support the stated cold-email campaign purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, confirm you intend to use MachFive for outbound email generation and are comfortable sharing lead data and sender signatures with that service. Review credit costs before approving previews or generation, especially enrichment and batches, and use notification emails or polling only for jobs you actually want completed.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789029976199}}}}}